%20is%20your%20ambition%3F","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Brazen","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2017-05-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03#:~:text=Where%20is%20your%20ambition%3F","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Brazen\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 May 2017."}},{"id":"brazen-2017-05-03-e19","summary":"The nine survivors reach Bontu's summit chamber, having lost Imi to scarabs, and Bontu displays a scale at a bridge across serpent-filled water.","participants":["bontu","gideon-jura","djeru","meris","imi","tah-crop"],"location":"bontu-s-monument","importance":"major","page":"stories/brazen-2017-05-03","order":159,"story_date":"2017-05-03","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":164,"quote":"We were now nine.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03#:~:text=We%20were%20now%20nine.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Brazen","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2017-05-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03#:~:text=We%20were%20now%20nine.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Brazen\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 May 2017."}},{"id":"brazen-2017-05-03-e20","summary":"Bontu announces her toll of one heart from each, saying the initiates' numbers are too great.","participants":["bontu","gideon-jura","djeru","tah-crop"],"location":"bontu-s-monument","importance":"major","page":"stories/brazen-2017-05-03","order":159,"story_date":"2017-05-03","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":176,"quote":"Pay the toll, or fall short and perish.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03#:~:text=Pay%20the%20toll%2C%20or%20fall%20short%20and%20perish.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Brazen","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2017-05-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03#:~:text=Pay%20the%20toll%2C%20or%20fall%20short%20and%20perish.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Brazen\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 May 2017."}},{"id":"brazen-2017-05-03-e21","summary":"The initiates turn on each other for hearts: Neit kills an initiate, Kamat fights Neit, and Nassor kills Tarik.","participants":["neit","kamat","basetha","nassor","tarik"],"location":"bontu-s-monument","importance":"major","page":"stories/brazen-2017-05-03","order":159,"story_date":"2017-05-03","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":179,"quote":"Neit was charging across toward the scales","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03#:~:text=Neit%20was%20charging%20across%20toward%20the%20scales","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Brazen","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2017-05-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03#:~:text=Neit%20was%20charging%20across%20toward%20the%20scales","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Brazen\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 May 2017."}},{"id":"brazen-2017-05-03-e22","summary":"Meris and Djeru choose not to fight; Djeru embraces Meris and then drowns him in the serpent pool, cutting out his heart for the toll.","participants":["djeru","meris"],"location":"bontu-s-monument","importance":"major","page":"stories/brazen-2017-05-03","order":159,"story_date":"2017-05-03","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":191,"quote":"Then he shoved him into the water.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03#:~:text=Then%20he%20shoved%20him%20into%20the%20water.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Brazen","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2017-05-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03#:~:text=Then%20he%20shoved%20him%20into%20the%20water.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Brazen\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 May 2017."}},{"id":"brazen-2017-05-03-e23","summary":"Bontu drains Gideon's strength with her gaze and commands him to watch while Djeru finishes the killing.","participants":["bontu","gideon-jura","djeru","meris"],"location":"bontu-s-monument","importance":"minor","page":"stories/brazen-2017-05-03","order":159,"story_date":"2017-05-03","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":194,"quote":"Watch, Kytheon Iora. Quiet your judgment, and learn.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03#:~:text=Watch%2C%20Kytheon%20Iora.%20Quiet%20your%20judgment%2C%20and%20learn.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Brazen","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2017-05-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03#:~:text=Watch%2C%20Kytheon%20Iora.%20Quiet%20your%20judgment%2C%20and%20learn.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Brazen\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 May 2017."}},{"id":"brazen-2017-05-03-e24","summary":"Gideon furiously denounces the slaughter and dives across to confront Bontu, who calls him brazen and ignoran